OL,3,GNEWSAEx-footballer's death 'challenging
OL,4,Acase to unpick'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of a former professional
OL,7,Ffootballer was "a really difficult and
OL,8,Fvery challenging case to try to
OL,9,Funpick," a pathologist said.
OL,11,FColin Flatt, 81, who had played for
OL,12,FSouthend United, Leyton Orient and
OL,13,FBarnet, died in September 2021.
OL,15,FA jury at Essex Coroner's Court has
OL,16,Fbeen told how Flatt, who had dementia,
OL,17,Fhad been treated in several settings
OL,18,Ffrom May 2021, including at Basildon
OL,19,FHospital where he stabbed himself in
OL,20,Fthe abdomen before falling from height
OL,21,Fon to a glass table on 27 July.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
