OL,3,GNEWSAEx-footballer's death 'challenging
OL,4,Acase to unpick'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGiving evidence, Dr Virginia Louise
OL,7,FFitzpatrick-Swallow told the inquest
OL,8,Fhow the injuries he sustained
OL,9,Fultimately led to him developing
OL,10,Fbronchopneumonia and other health
OL,11,Fissues that caused his death.
